<title>USA: Access Health adopts shareholder rights.</title>
<headline>Access Health adopts shareholder rights.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO CORDOVA, Calif. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Access Health Inc said Thursday it adopted a plan that would make it prohibitively expensive for another company to make an unsolicited bid for it.</p>
<p>The health care management company said its shareholder rights plan was not in response to any recent attempts to buy it.</p>
